SHAPEFILE_2_MERGE_DEF SHAPEFILE_2::T2019_KAR_STREET_NODE EXACT T2019_KAR_STREET_NODE
SHAPEFILE_3_MERGE_DEF SHAPEFILE_3::T2019_KAR_STREETS EXACT T2019_KAR_STREETS
